[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4777593534","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/5100#issuecomment-4777593534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5100","id":4777593534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABHMRKvg","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T09:11:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T09:11:39Z","body":"Thanks for the report. #4890 changed this to align Base UI’s computed validity with native constraint validation: disabled controls are excluded from validation/submission and a disabled `<input>` matches neither `:valid` nor `:invalid`.\n\nThe `invalid` prop is a separate case, though. It’s an app-controlled signal rather than browser constraint validation, so disabling the field likely should not hide that explicit invalid state. I think we should keep computed validity suppressed while disabled, but still emit `data-invalid` for an explicitly invalid disabled field.\n\nIs there a concrete use case for surfacing invalid state on a disabled field? Since browsers don’t expose this through `:invalid`, it’d help to know how you’re relying on it, for example disabling a form during submit while a value is still flagged.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4777593534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4779620627","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/5100#issuecomment-4779620627","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5100","id":4779620627,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABHOM5Ew","user":{"login":"cgatian","id":1752170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1752170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian","html_url":"https://github.com/cgatian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cgatian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T13:18:34Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T13:18:34Z","body":"I reported this issue due to a regression in our unit testing. We don't rely on `data-invalid` in this specific case. The issue was more to just raise awareness of the behavior change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comme